      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766590209406,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: massive number of views(70B) & videos(1 hr of youtube\ncontent every second) \n- Low latency interms of fetching the result. \n- Result should be precise not approximate. \n- availability >> Consistency: Eventual consistency interms of the\nupdation of views.\n\n4) Core Entities \n- Video  \n- View  \n- Time Window\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: massive number of views(70B) & videos(1 hr of youtube content every second) \n- Low latency interms of fetching the result. \n- Result should be precise not approximate. \n- availability >> Consistency: Eventual consistency interms of the updation of views.\n\n4) Core Entities \n- Video  \n- View  \n- Time Window\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 739.6131573938732,
      "y": 1032.2950465970523,
      "width": 725.6259140844274,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408070254,
      "version": 2137,
      "versionNonce": 260194371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766590239673,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) API Design \n\nGET/videos/top-k? window = {window} & k = {k}\n    Output: {partial<Video[]>}\n\n- In the above we could have used pagination, however we have\nrestricted k to max 1k hence we are not using pagination.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) API Design \n\nGET/videos/top-k? window = {window} & k = {k}\n    Output: {partial<Video[]>}\n\n- In the above we could have used pagination, however we have restricted k to max 1k hence we are not using pagination.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
